# WhatsApp Chatbot — Production Setup & Troubleshooting Guide

> [!IMPORTANT]
> This document covers the complete setup for connecting a WhatsApp Business Number to the Galaxia chatbot system. Use this when adding new numbers (Staycation 1, Staycation 2, etc.).

---

## Architecture

```
WhatsApp User → Meta Cloud API → Webhook POST → galaxiaresorts.com/bot/webhook
                                                        ↓
                                              Vercel API Route (Next.js)
                                                        ↓
                                              EC2:4000 (Main Backend Proxy)
                                                        ↓
                                              EC2:4001 (wa-chatbot PM2 service)
                                                        ↓
                                              Bot Logic → Meta Send API → Reply to User
```

### Key Components

| Component | Location | Purpose |
|-----------|----------|---------|
| **Vercel API Route** | `FRONTEND/galaxia/app/bot/webhook/route.ts` | HTTPS webhook endpoint — forwards POST to EC2 |
| **Main Backend Proxy** | `backend/src/index.ts` (line ~38) | Reverse proxies `/bot/*` to localhost:4001 |
| **Bot Server** | `galaxia-whatsapp-bot23/galaxia-whatsapp-bot2/server.js` | Handles webhook, bot logic, DB, Meta API |
| **WhatsApp Utils** | `galaxia-whatsapp-bot23/galaxia-whatsapp-bot2/utils/whatsapp.js` | Sends messages via Meta Graph API (v21.0) |
| **Dashboard** | `FRONTEND/galaxia/app/chatbot/dashboard/page.tsx` | Admin chat dashboard |
| **Bot Menu Data** | `galaxia-whatsapp-bot23/galaxia-whatsapp-bot2/data/faqMenu.js` | All bot responses & menu structure |
| **PDF Service** | `backend/src/lib/pdfService.ts` | Generates booking confirmation PDFs |
| **WA Booking Service** | `backend/src/lib/whatsappService.ts` | Sends booking confirmation via WhatsApp |

