### 4. Deploy Bot Changes

```bash
cd ~/galaxia && git pull
cd wa-chatbot
cp ~/galaxia/galaxia-whatsapp-bot23/galaxia-whatsapp-bot2/server.js .
cp ~/galaxia/galaxia-whatsapp-bot23/galaxia-whatsapp-bot2/data/faqMenu.js data/
pm2 restart wa-chatbot
pm2 logs wa-chatbot --lines 5
```

### 5. Deploy Backend Changes

```bash
cd ~/galaxia/backend
git pull
npm run build
pm2 restart galaxia-api
```

