## Troubleshooting Checklist

### Bot not receiving messages

| # | Check | Command | Expected |
|---|-------|---------|----------|
| 1 | Bot server running? | `pm2 status` | wa-chatbot: online |
| 2 | Bot healthy? | `curl http://localhost:4001/webhook?hub.mode=subscribe&hub.verify_token=galaxia_verify_token&hub.challenge=OK` | `OK` |
| 3 | Backend proxying? | `pm2 logs galaxia-api --lines 10` | Shows `[Bot Proxy] POST /webhook` |
| 4 | **WABA subscribed?** | Run subscribe script above | `{"success": true}` |
| 5 | Messages field on? | Check Meta Dashboard → Webhook fields | Toggle = blue |

### Admin replies not delivered

| Check | Fix |
|-------|-----|
| Wrong `phone_number_id` in DB | Admin send uses `process.env.WHATSAPP_PHONE_ID` as fallback |
| Token expired | Generate new System User token in Meta Business Manager |

