## Booking Confirmation Flow (Digital Diaries)

When a DD booking is created:
1. **Email** sent via `sendDDBookingEmail()` 
2. **WhatsApp** message sent via `sendDDBookingConfirmation()` with clickable PDF link
3. PDF link: `https://galaxiaresorts.com/api/bookings/dd/voucher/{bookingRef}`
4. PDF opens **inline** in browser (viewable), downloads as `Galaxia-DD-{ref}.pdf`

