## Adding a New WhatsApp Number (Quick Checklist)

- [ ] Get Phone Number ID and Access Token from Meta Business Manager
- [ ] Add to wa-chatbot `.env` on EC2
- [ ] Add to backend `.env` on EC2 (`STAY1_WHATSAPP_*` etc.)
- [ ] Add to `PHONE_NUMBERS` in dashboard `page.tsx`
- [ ] Update `getCreds()` in wa-chatbot `utils/whatsapp.js`
- [ ] Set webhook URL: `https://galaxiaresorts.com/bot/webhook` in Meta Dashboard
- [ ] **Run `subscribed_apps` API call** for the WABA
- [ ] Subscribe to `messages` field in Meta Dashboard
- [ ] Restart: `pm2 restart wa-chatbot && pm2 restart galaxia-api`
- [ ] Test: Send "Hi" from the new number
